		<content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>Salut mtcocktail,</p><p>J&#039;ai fais la commande : netstat -tpln | grep 5432<br />J&#039;ai eu sa:</p><br /><p>tcp&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; 0&#160; &#160; &#160; 0 127.0.0.1:5432&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; 0.0.0.0:*&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;LISTEN&#160; &#160; &#160; 2896/postgres&#160; &#160;<br />tcp6&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;0&#160; &#160; &#160; 0 ::1:5432&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; :::*&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; LISTEN&#160; &#160; &#160; 2896/postgres</p>]]></content>
